{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "nexusgate-monitoring",
  "title": "NexusGate — Gateway Monitoring",
  "description": "Monitoring dashboard for NexusGate, a developer-focused API Gateway platform. Provides visibility into request traffic by service, gateway response times, authentication failures, rate-limit rejections, HTTP outcomes, and JVM health.\n\nMetrics are collected from the gateway through Spring Boot Actuator and Micrometer, scraped by Prometheus, and visualized in Grafana. Use this dashboard to observe gateway behavior, identify potential issues, and validate the impact of traffic and configuration changes during development and testing.",
